{"id":"183594346c3dc6c2","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-interpretation.md","title":"Interpretation","display":"df-interpretation — Interpretation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-interpretation","aliases":["58-df-interpretation"],"display":"df-interpretation — Interpretation","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-interpretation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-interpretation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-interpretation — Interpretation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\mathfrak M,I\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\mathfrak M,I\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\land\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cst}:V\\to V\\land\\mathrm{Fun},\\mathrm{Rel}:V^2\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cst}:V\\to V\\land\\mathrm{Fun},\\mathrm{Rel}:V^2\\to V\\)</span> (component notation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathrm{cst}}\\in V\\land\\langle I_{\\mathrm{fun},n}\\rangle_{n\\in\\omega},\\langle I_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\rangle_{n\\in\\omega}\\in V\">\\(I_{\\mathrm{cst}}\\in V\\land\\langle I_{\\mathrm{fun},n}\\rangle_{n\\in\\omega},\\langle I_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\rangle_{n\\in\\omega}\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Interpretation}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Interpretation}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_C,I_F,I_R\">\\(I_C,I_F,I_R\\)</span> 在正文存在量化，分别编码原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathrm{cst}}\">\\(I_{\\mathrm{cst}}\\)</span> 与两个按元数索引的族；不另加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M\">\\(\\mathfrak M\\)</span> 自带解释的条件。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpretation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Interpretation}_S(I,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists I_C,I_F,I_R\\;\\Bigl(I=\\langle I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_F,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(I_F))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_R,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(I_R))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_C,\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst},\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(I_F(n),\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)^{\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)^n})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{40mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_R(n),\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n,\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)^n))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}interpretation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Interpretation}_S(I,\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathcal L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists I_C,I_F,I_R\\;\\Bigl(I=\\langle I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_F,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(I_F))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_R,\\omega,\\operatorname{ran}(I_R))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_C,\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst},\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(I_F(n),\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)^{\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)^n})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{40mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(I_R(n),\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n,\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak M)^n))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An interpretation assigns meanings to nonlogical symbols.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"re